      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXORBITANT (3) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in four starts, including three wins. Hit the frame latest (22.09) when second at Bulli in a Grade 5. Looks suited and should go close. WRECK IT REX (2) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (29.80) at The Gardens. Cannot be taken lightly. MAGICAL ANG (1) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 7th at Wentworth Park in Grade 4 company. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from four starts. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. LARRIKIN PIONEER (8) can run a bold race on best form.",
